OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fwarm evening sunshine to come, then
OL,7,Fremaining dry and fine overnight with
OL,8,Flong clear spells.
OL,9,
OL,10,CMonday:FAnother largely dry day with
OL,11,Fsunny spells, especially in the west.
OL,12,FNortheastern coasts may see cloud
OL,13,Foccasionally move in from the North
OL,14,FSea, with the odd spot of rain
OL,15,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
